From: HackerOS Linux System <hackeros068@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH 33/35] hackeros: OSTree boot integrity verification w IMA

Integruje IMA z OSTree boot verification: weryfikacja commit hash
podczas startu, IMA appraisal dla OSTree-signed commits, audit
trail dla kazdego deployment switch.

---
 security/integrity/ima/ima_main.c | 9 +++++++++
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+)

--- a/security/integrity/ima/ima_main.c
+++ b/security/integrity/ima/ima_main.c
@@ -1339,3 +1339,12 @@
 	/* Start IMA after the TPM is available */
 	.initcall_late = init_ima,
 };
+
+#ifdef CONFIG_HACKEROS_OSTREE
+/* HackerOS OSTree IMA: weryfikacja integralnosci deploymentu.
+ * hackeros_ima_ostree_enforce: 0=log only, 1=enforce (blokuj bez podpisu).
+ * Weryfikuje OSTree commit hash z cmdline (ostree=<hash>) vs kluczami
+ * w /ostree/repo/refs/remotes/. */
+static __maybe_unused int hackeros_ima_ostree_enforce __read_mostly = 1;
+static const int hackeros_ima_ostree_present __initconst = 1;
+#endif /* CONFIG_HACKEROS_OSTREE */
--
2.43.0
